move mv_0: transfers
  on day_mv_0
  at day_mv_0
  leg cash from acc_0 to acc_3 amount amt_mv_0

input amt_mv_1: money DUK question "How much does mv_1 move?"

input day_mv_1: date question "On what day does mv_1 move?"

move mv_1: transfers
  on day_mv_1
  at day_mv_1
  leg cash from out_0 to acc_0 amount amt_mv_1

